    rdfs:label "Azpeitia et al. (2021) & Prusinkiewicz et al. (2007) TFL1-LFY-AP1/CAL-SOC1 floral GRN perturbation and accelerating plastochron Romanesco fractal inflorescence morphogenesis (Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant))",
        "Azpeitia et al. (2021) & Prusinkiewicz et al. (2007) TFL1-LFY-AP1/CAL-SOC1 floral GRN perturbation and accelerating plastochron Romanesco fractal inflorescence morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant) morphology" ;
