        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2021-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Brassica oleracea var. botrytis (Romanesco & Cauliflower curds) and Arabidopsis thaliana (ap1 cal mutant) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 52.8/100, audit 2026-10-19-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2021-pringle-roman-esco-fractal-inflorescence.py> ;
